    "biography_summary": "Maija Dragūne is a Latvian graphic artist. She works in graphic art and book illustration, as well as paints watercolours. Maija Dragūne made a great contribution to the illustration of Latvian books, working on the editions of notable authors: Ojārs Vācietis, Jānis Baltvilks, Vitauts Ļūdēns."
